{
  "uid": "flotte-quiz",
  "title": "Flotte du quiz : pourquoi un carré s'éteint",
  "description": "Quatre questions, dix secondes chacune : trafic, réponse, dépendances, version.",
  "tags": ["bataille-des-services"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": { "from": "now-15m", "to": "now" },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "1 · Trafic : le service reçoit-il des requêtes ?",
      "description": "Courbe à plat sur un carré éteint : plus rien n'arrive. Courbe qui monte avant l'extinction : la charge. Les 5xx montrent un service qui répond mais n'arrive plus à travailler. Pour le front, la sonde externe envoie aussi une requête toutes les 5 s : sa courbe « autres requêtes » ne tombe à zéro que si le front ne répond plus.",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 12, "h": 9 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (job) (rate(quiz_http_requetes_total{route=\"/travail\"}[30s]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} · coups sur /travail"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (job) (rate(quiz_http_requetes_total{route!=\"/travail\"}[30s]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} · autres requêtes"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (job) (rate(quiz_http_requetes_total{code=~\"5..\"}[30s]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} · réponses en erreur (5xx)"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byRegexp", "options": ".*5xx.*" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } },
              { "id": "custom.lineStyle", "value": { "fill": "dash", "dash": [6, 4] } }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "2 · Réponse : répond-il, et en combien de temps ?",
      "description": "Latence qui explose avant l'extinction : saturation. Extinction sans montée de latence : autre chose. Les instances comptent les exemplaires que Prometheus joint vraiment. Pour le front, la sonde externe (blackbox) mesure en plus le temps de chargement de la page, comme un navigateur.",
      "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 0, "w": 12, "h": 9 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (job, le) (rate(quiz_http_duree_secondes_bucket{route=\"/travail\"}[30s])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} · p95 de /travail"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (job) (up{job=~\"front|api|stats\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} · instances qui répondent"
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "max by (service) (probe_duration_seconds{service=\"front\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} · temps de réponse (sonde)"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byRegexp", "options": ".*instances.*" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "unit", "value": "none" },
              { "id": "decimals", "value": 0 },
              { "id": "custom.axisPlacement", "value": "right" },
              { "id": "custom.axisLabel", "value": "instances" },
              { "id": "custom.lineInterpolation", "value": "stepAfter" },
              { "id": "custom.fillOpacity", "value": 0 }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "3 · Dépendances : vont-elles bien ?",
      "description": "Base KO et tableau OK : panne 2 ou 4. Base OK et tableau KO : panne 6, le service va bien mais ne joint plus le tableau de la classe. Pavillon KO : panne 3. « répond » KO : le process lui-même est mort ou injoignable (panne 1, 5). Front « répond » OK mais « page servie » KO : le process vit mais ne sert plus la page.",
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 9, "w": 12, "h": 9 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "min by (job, dependance) (quiz_dependance_ok)",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} → {{dependance}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "min by (job) ((time() - quiz_pulse_dernier_succes_timestamp_secondes) < bool 15)",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} → tableau (pulse)"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "min by (job) (quiz_pavillon_lisible) > -1",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} → pavillon"
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "min by (job) (up{job=~\"front|api|stats\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} → répond"
        },
        {
          "refId": "E",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "min by (service) (probe_success{service=\"front\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} → page servie (sonde)"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            { "type": "value", "options": { "1": { "text": "OK", "color": "green", "index": 0 } } },
            { "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "KO", "color": "red", "index": 1 } } }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 1 }
            ]
          },
          "noValue": "aucune donnée"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "horizontal"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "4 · Version : celle qui tourne est-elle celle qu'on croit ?",
      "description": "Une ligne par service et par version. Un service qui manque, ou une version différente des autres après un push : panne 5 ou livraison incomplète.",
      "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 9, "w": 12, "h": 9 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "count by (job, version) (quiz_version_info)",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": { "Time": true },
            "indexByName": { "job": 0, "version": 1, "Value": 2 },
            "renameByName": { "job": "service", "version": "version (sha)", "Value": "exemplaires" }
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": {}, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "showHeader": true, "sortBy": [{ "displayName": "service", "desc": false }] }
    }
  ]
}
